## Signing secrets - NEVER commit these
## The .p8 App Store Connect key cannot be re-downloaded from Apple, and anyone
## holding it can upload builds and manage the App Store listing.
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
AuthKey_*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest

